{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "唠叨的定义与后果", "content": "唠叨指一方持续重复说，另一方持续不听，导致双方生气。唠叨会让婚姻中的另一方感觉被当作不负责任的小孩，使关系角色变得不平等，类似妈妈与青少年或爸爸与青少年的关系，造成彼此不信任和负面情绪。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["唠叨", "婚姻关系", "不平等", "负面情绪"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-84ccfa83066f-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-84ccfa83066f", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-84ccfa83066f-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
